## Import

Import using `<project_id>/<branch_id>`:

```hcl
import {
  to = {{ .Name }}.this
  id = "cool-moon-123/br-cool-moon-456"
}
```

Or use the CLI:

```commandline
terraform import {{ .Name }}.this "cool-moon-123/br-cool-moon-456"
```
